          "question": "e-3623",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of $3\\sin{\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{8}\\right)}\\cos{\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{8}\\right)}.$",
